{
  "helpers": {
    "fuyao_latest_quote": [
      "快速查询单只A股最新行情。query传公司名称或标准代码；一次工具调用内完成名称消歧与行情查询，返回北京时间、元和股单位、耗时。不缓存价格；ambiguous时请用户选候选。优先用于简单的最新行情请求，无需先调用status/help/search。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "query": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "query"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ],
    "fuyao_status": [
      "查看插件版本、接口覆盖、密钥是否配置；只读本机，不显示密钥、不发起远程请求。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "required": [],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ],
    "fuyao_tool_help": [
      "读取某个接口的完整参数、字段与分页说明。调用不熟悉的接口前使用。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "tool": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "tool"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ],
    "fuyao_query_batch": [
      "顺序执行最多20个公开数据查询，逐项报告成功/失败；save=true保存完整JSON。不会自动拆分单个请求参数。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "requests": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 20,
            "items": {
              "type": "object",
              "properties": {
                "tool": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "minLength": 1
                },
                "arguments": {
                  "type": "object"
                }
              },
              "required": [
                "tool"
              ],
              "additionalProperties": false
            }
          },
          "save": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "requests"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ],
    "fuyao_collect_pages": [
      "按文档指定的响应数组路径和分页参数逐页取数，保存完整JSON。支持offset/page/不透明cursor，最多20页；明确返回是否取尽。先用fuyao_tool_help核对字段路径。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "tool": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "arguments": {
            "type": "object"
          },
          "mode": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "offset",
              "page",
              "cursor"
            ]
          },
          "items_path": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "cursor_parameter": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "next_cursor_path": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "max_pages": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 20
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "tool",
          "arguments",
          "mode",
          "items_path"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "official": {
    "fuyao_ifind_status": [
      "官方 iFinD 本机配置状态；不登录、不消耗数据额度、不显示账号密码。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {},
        "required": [],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ],
    "fuyao_ifind_query": [
      "官方 iFinD SDK 查询，args 是字符串数组，保留空串。签名：HQ(codes,indicators,options,start,end); BD(codes,indicators,parameters); DS(codes,indicators,parameters,global_options,start,end); RQ(codes,indicators[,options]); DR(report,parameters,options); EDB(indicators,options,start,end); DataStatistics(); WC(query,domain); ReportQuery(codes,parameters,output)。不熟悉指标须核对官方文档。保留错误码，不替换数据源。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "api": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "THS_HQ",
              "THS_BD",
              "THS_DS",
              "THS_RQ",
              "THS_DR",
              "THS_EDB",
              "THS_DataStatistics",
              "THS_WC",
              "THS_ReportQuery"
            ]
          },
          "args": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 6,
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "api",
          "args"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ],
    "fuyao_ifind_history": [
      "官方 iFinD 历史日行情 THS_HQ；明确起止日期，默认不复权 CPS:1，返回真实交易日期；休市日不会伪造收盘价。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "codes": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "indicators": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "start_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "end_date": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "options": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "codes",
          "indicators",
          "start_date",
          "end_date"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ],
    "fuyao_ifind_basic": [
      "官方 iFinD 基础/财务指标 THS_BD。必须明确官方指标代码及匹配参数；报告期和查询日分别按指标契约传入，不自动施加披露截止日。",
      {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "codes": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "indicators": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "parameters": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "codes",
          "indicators",
          "parameters"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false
      }
    ]
  }
}